<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Asyst Technologies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Asyst Technologies.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montgomery Securities said it initiated coverage of Asyst Technologies Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- After the market closed on Wednesday, Asyst posted fourth quarter operating earnings of $0.52 a share on net sales of $34.8 million, compared to operating earnings of $0.01 a share on net sales of $34.2 million a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Asyst gained 5-5/8 to 34-1/2.</p>
</text>
